OL,3,GNEWSADesalination to restart as
OL,4,Areservoir levels drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey Water has called on islanders to
OL,7,Fkeep conserving water as reservoir
OL,8,Flevels drop with the island's total
OL,9,Fwater storage currently at just 57% and
OL,10,F"falling quickly".
OL,12,FThe firm said it had decided to restart
OL,13,Fthe desalination plant and would
OL,14,Fcontinue to monitor the situation
OL,15,Fclosely.
OL,17,FIt said the plant had already run for
OL,18,Ftwo months this year and helped boost
OL,19,Fwater supplies by more than 200 million
OL,20,Flitres.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,444,440,260,160,0,100
