OL,3,GNEWSADesalination to restart as
OL,4,Areservoir levels drop
OL,5,
OL,6,FMark Bowden, the firm's head of water
OL,7,Fresilience and emergency planning,
OL,8,Fsaid: "After such a dry spring and
OL,9,Fsummer, if we don't get sufficient rain
OL,10,Fbefore the end of the year, it could
OL,11,Fput us in a really difficult position
OL,12,Fgoing into 2027."
